  "problem": "Consider the vector space ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$ of all $2\\times 2$ matrices over $R,$  and its subset $T$ containing all $2\\times 2$ matrices of the form $[\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ 0 & c\\end{aligned}].$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $T$ is closed under matrix addition\n\nII. $T$ is closed under scalar multiplication\n\nIII. $T$ is a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$\n\nIV. $T$ is **not** a subspace of ${\\text{M}}_{2}(R)$",
